title: "Audio Ops Framework"
abstract: >-
  A Python framework for audio machine learning. A task described in a
  config file gets feature extraction, training, evaluation, batch scoring
  and a streaming inference API, with the offline pipeline run by Dagster.
authors:
  - name: "Saxion University of Applied Sciences, research group Ambient Intelligence"
